2️⃣7️⃣ Circular Track

Suppose two runners start at the same point.

Track length:

\[
400m
\]

Speeds:

\[
5m/s,\ 3m/s
\]

Same direction.

Relative speed:

\[
5-3=2m/s
\]

Time to overtake:

\[
400/2
\]

\[
\boxed{200s}
\]


---

2️⃣8️⃣ Opposite Direction on Circular Track

Same track:

\[
400m
\]

Speeds:

\[
5m/s,\ 3m/s
\]

Opposite direction:

\[
Relative=5+3=8m/s
\]

Time to meet:

\[
400/8
\]

\[
\boxed{50s}
\]


