🔥 2️⃣9️⃣ Speed–Time Graph

For constant speed:

Speed
  │
  │────────────
  │
  │
  └────────────── Time

Distance travelled is:

\[
\boxed{Area\ under\ speed-time\ graph}
\]

For constant speed:

\[
Distance=Speed\times Time
\]


---

3️⃣0️⃣ Distance-Time Graph

For constant speed:

Distance
   │       /
   │      /
   │     /
   │    /
   │___/________ Time

Slope represents:

\[
\boxed{Speed}
\]

🔥 Important:

> Slope of distance-time graph = speed



> Area under speed-time graph = distance




