🧠 3️⃣5️⃣ THE 10-SECOND DECISION TREE

When you see a Time-Speed-Distance question:

TSD Question
                   │
          ┌────────┴────────┐
          │                 │
       Same direction    Opposite
          │                 │
       Subtract            Add
          │                 │
       Relative Speed

For trains:

Pole/person
→ Train length

Platform
→ Train + Platform

Two trains
→ Train lengths added
→ Relative speed

For boats:

Downstream → B + S
Upstream   → B - S

For average speed:

General → Total D / Total T

Equal distance → 2ab/(a+b)

Equal time → (a+b)/2


